    "description": "Request for Quotation Introduction HRNS Ethiopia therefore invites qualified and legally registered/licensed organizations with demonstrated experience in translation, voiceover production, and video editing to submit a quotation for the provision of the services described below. Objectives The objective of this assignment is to translate, record, and localize twelve (12) existing English-language explainer videos totalling 30 minutes into Afaan Oromo, while maintaining the original meaning, quality, timing, and visual integrity of the videos. Scope of Work We are requesting a comprehensive service package and would appreciate receiving a detailed quotation for the following tasks. The videos are short scribble explainers as detailed in the table below: No. c&c tool video Minute 1 Coffee plot renovation 03:30 min 2 Record keeping and profitability analysis 03:31 min 3 Bottle Irrigation 01:41 min 4 Symbiotic fungi 02:00 min 5 Grafting in nurseries 02:30 min 6 Runoff barriers 01:27 min 7 Beetle traps 02:06 min 8 Gypsum application to soil 01:00 min 9 Deeper polybags 01:04 min 10 Coffee rehabilitation 03:39 min 11 Soil analysis 05:16 min 12 Lime Application (in production) 01:30 min The service provider will undertake the following tasks : Translation: Translate the provided English text document, including timecodes, into Afaan Oromo. Maintain the original meaning, technical terminology, context, and intended messages of the videos. Ensure the translations are grammatically correct and culturally appropriate. Submit the translated script to HRNS Ethiopia for review and approval before recording. Voiceover Production: Select suitable voice-over artists with clear pronunciation and an appropriate tone for this assignment. Submit the voices to HRNS Ethiopia for approval. Record the translated text in Afaan Oromo, using professional recording equipment and environment, to ensure high-quality audio. Video Editing: Remove or replace the existing English voiceover from the video while preserving the original visual content and atmospheric sounds. Replace it with the newly recorded Afaan Oromo voiceovers and subtitles. Adjust the lengths of the illustrative images where necessary to correspond with the new narration. Submit the videos to HRNS Ethiopia for review and approval. Deliverables Twelve (12) translated text documents in Afaan Oromo, including timecodes. Twelve (12) recorded voiceovers in Afaan Oromo. Twelve (12) edited videos in Afaan Oromo with the new voiceovers, subtitles, and adjusted illustrative stills. All deliverables shall be submitted in editable/source formats where applicable, in addition to the final (MP4) publication-ready files. Quality Assurance The service provider shall be responsible for ensuring the accuracy and technical quality of all deliverables. HRNS Ethiopia will review the submitted translations, voiceovers, and final videos and may provide comments or request reasonable revisions. The service provider shall incorporate agreed revisions and submit the final approved versions within the agreed timeframe. Timeline The assignment is expected to be completed within four weeks after the contract is signed and the required source materials are received. Bidders are required to indicate in their quotation clearly: Estimated time required for translation; Estimated time required for voiceover recording; Estimated time required for video editing/localization; and Total lead time required to complete all deliverables. The proposed work schedule should allow sufficient time for HRNS Ethiopia's review and feedback.",
